# Tauri dev-watcher ignore (gitignore syntax, relative to src-tauri/).
#
# Tauri only auto-ignores the top-level `target/` dir, NOT the nested
# gateway-host crate target. During `tauri dev` the app re-signs/re-stages the
# gateway-host helper (and nested sidecars) on every launch, which the watcher
# would otherwise see as a source change -> rebuild -> relaunch -> re-sign ->
# infinite rebuild loop spawning app instances back to back.
#
# These are build OUTPUTS, never hand-edited source — safe to ignore from the
# watcher. (build.rs still validates externalBin via cargo rerun-if-changed,
# independent of this watcher.)
gateway-host/target/
binaries/
